{
  "__comment": [
    "Seasonal colour palettes for all surface block variants (grass × 16, dirt × 4).",
    "Loaded once at boot alongside terrain_blocks.json.",
    "",
    "Structure: { variant_key: { season: hex_color } }",
    "  variant_key — suffix of the block URI: 'grass_01' … 'grass_16', 'dirt_01' … 'dirt_04'",
    "  season      — 'spring' | 'summer' | 'autumn' | 'winter'",
    "  hex_color   — 6-digit RGB hex string (no alpha)",
    "",
    "Runtime lookup (GDScript sketch):",
    "  var variant := block_uri.get_slice(':', 3)           # e.g. 'grass_04'",
    "  var palette := SurfacePalettes.get(variant, {})",
    "  var color   := palette.get(WorldClock.season, block_def.hex_color)",
    "",
    "Palette design notes:",
    "  Grass:",
    "    spring  — fresh yellow-greens to medium greens; lighter, higher lightness",
    "    summer  — deep lush greens; the hex_color baseline in terrain_blocks.json",
    "    autumn  — warm oranges, golds, and rusty browns",
    "    winter  — snow whites with a cool blue-grey tint; low saturation",
    "  Dirt:",
    "    spring  — darker and wetter; rain-soaked earth",
    "    summer  — dry and pale; the hex_color baseline in terrain_blocks.json",
    "    autumn  — mid-tone earthy brown; leaf-litter undertone",
    "    winter  — frost-grey; cold and pale"
  ],

